#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
MuslimSim Cockpit Bridge v47 - startup display soft reboot

Decoded MSFS packet:
    OVHD,P1,P2,P3,APU_EGT_RAW,LAND_ALT,FLT_ALT,LIGHT_MASK,P8\n

Core output drives:
    P4 = APU EGT raw
    P5 = LAND ALT
    P6 = FLT ALT
    P7 = live 32-bit PU overhead annunciators
    P8 = panel brightness

Runtime dependencies:
    Bundled in MuslimSim.exe: pyserial, pygame, hidapi, websocket-client.
    Source-tree developers may install them in their development Python environment.

Run:
    python pu_output_bridge.py
or:
    python pu_output_bridge.py --port COM5 --baud 9600

Dry-run without opening COM5:
    python pu_output_bridge.py --dry-run

Developer stamp:
    MuslimSim — embedded attribution for this custom WinCtrl / Zibo bridge.
"""

